  "notes": [
    "React handlers, authentication, timers and backend actions are not transferred into a working Figma prototype by an HTML capture. Wire the listed frame links explicitly.",
    "Decorative absolute layers (backdrops, poster badges, SVG and WebGL) are intentional. Data forms, gateway grid and summary flow are the layout focus.",
    "Use a labelled disposable test session for private/payment frames; prototype links represent state transitions and do not execute payments."
  ],
